# Digest-checked JSON must keep the exact LF bytes that were hashed. The agency
# pack registry compares raw SHA-256 digests of these files and the release
# test-evidence receipt hashes release/*.json and schemas/*.json byte for byte,
# so a core.autocrlf checkout that writes CRLF makes a pack look "stale".
# `text eol=lf` writes LF on checkout whatever core.autocrlf says, and turns
# any CRLF back into LF before it can be committed.
artifacts/agency-packs/**/*.json text eol=lf
release/**/*.json text eol=lf
schemas/**/*.json text eol=lf
